<title>USA: Senior Tour Players Q1 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Senior Tour Players Q1 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qtr Ended    Qtr Ended</p>
<p>					     Mar 31, 1997  Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p> Revenues				     $1,364,782   $1,580,986</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS)				68,894    ( 96,228)</p>
<p>Net Income (loss) per common</p>
<p>  and common equivalent share		   0.02	( 0.03)</p>
<p>Weighted avg common and common</p>
<p>  equivalent shares outstanding	  4,303,361    2,933,333</p>
<p>NOTE:  Senior Tour Players Inc said its net income for the first quarter of 1997 included a $38,000 loss representing the company's 21.5 percent equity interest in the Las Vegas International Golf Center, which commenced start-up operations during mid-January.</p>
